id: bestower
name: Bestower
order: 7
optionOf: spirit-of-namek
optionEffect: 4
grantsUnique: magical-enhancement
uniqueAdvancements: unleash-dormant-power
description: >
  Gain access to the Magical Enhancement Unique Ability and the Unleash Dormant Power Advancement. Additionally, when selecting a character to become Studied through the second effect of Intelligent Fighter, you may select an additional character to be Studied, but they must be an Ally.
text: >
  Bestower [Passive]: Gain access to the Magical Enhancement Unique Ability and the Unleash Dormant Power Advancement. Additionally, when selecting a character to become Studied through the second effect of Intelligent Fighter, you may select an additional character to be Studied, but they must be an Ally.

---

# Magical Enhancement, free, with Unleash Dormant Power bought on it (`uniqueAdvancements`); as the Round ends, a second one
# Studied - an Ally (chat.mjs studyCharacter).
[passive]
allow refined.bestower;
